  "label": "Cigarette as Metaphor for Disposal/Rejection",
  "description": "The act of crushing a cigarette is a common visual metaphor for discarding something unwanted, undesirable, or harmful. In this meme, the cigarette represents the person being targeted, implying they are being treated as trash or something to be destroyed. This metaphor relies on cultural understanding of cigarettes as symbols of vice, addiction, or low value.",
